  <main id="main">
    <div class="hero" id="top">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sumith Bhandari · London, UK</p>
        <h1>I build AI agents that run in production, and the backends behind them.</h1>
        <p class="tagline">AI Software Engineer in London. 4+ years of production backend and AI agent work in Python and TypeScript.</p>
        <ul class="proof">
          <li><a href="#exp-goodspeed">A Slack AI agent used daily by 16+ people</a></li>
          <li><a href="#exp-visiminds">A security testing pipeline cut from about 4 hours to under 15 minutes</a></li>
